<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes flat in slow trade.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes flat in slow trade.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat at 477.00/478.00 per bolivar in slow pre-Easter trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There was almost no movement, everyone's off on their Easter holidays,&quot; said one trader, adding that the Central Bank had covered whatever dollar demand there had been, thus keeping the exchange rate flat.</p>
<p>Markets will be closed Thursday and Friday for the Easter holidays. They re-open Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
